# Component Structure

## Naming
- PascalCase files: `FacultyCard.tsx`
- One primary export per file
- Suffix: `*Section` for page sections, `*Card` for cards, `*Provider` for providers

## Pattern
```tsx
// Server Component (default)
export function FacultyCard({ faculty }: FacultyCardProps) { ... }

// Client only when needed
"use client";
export function AnimatedCounter({ value }: Props) { ... }
```

## Composition
- `components/ui/` — primitives (Button, GlassCard, Badge)
- `components/layout/` — Header, Footer, Container
- `components/sections/` — homepage/page sections
- `components/animations/` — motion wrappers
- `components/3d/` — Three.js scenes

## Props
- Extend native HTML props where applicable
- Use `className` prop with `cn()` for style overrides
- Prefer composition over prop drilling; use providers for theme/locale

## Forbidden
- No business logic in UI primitives
- No direct fetch in leaf components — use services or server components
